## Quality bar

- Generic enough for a technical reader; avoid one-off folder paths unless the problem requires them
- Problem → architecture → stack → implementation should read as one coherent story
- No placeholder lorem; every section should teach how to solve the class of problem
- After creating files, verify nav includes Solutions and listing loads from `solutions.json`
